{
  "summary": "The gedit text editor is pre-installed in Ubuntu Linux and can also be installed through the Ubuntu Software Centre. To launch gedit, users can search for it in Dash Home and click the application icon, or alternatively open the terminal using the keyboard shortcut Ctrl + Alt + T, type gedit, and press Enter. The gedit interface features a menu bar, a toolbar containing common tool icons, a central editing area, and a status bar. Newly created files are assigned the default tab name Untitled Document 1. An asterisk appears beside the file name whenever unsaved changes are present. At the bottom, the status bar displays the cursor's line and column numbers alongside the text entry mode, which defaults to insert mode (INS). Users can save files by navigating to the File menu and selecting Save, which removes the unsaved asterisk indicator. Files can be closed through the File menu, and new documents can be opened either via the File menu or the toolbar's plus icon. Existing documents are accessed through File and Open.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact": "Gedit text editor comes pre-installed in the Ubuntu Linux operating system.",
      "evidence": "gedit text editor ऊबंटु लिनक्स ऑपरेटिंग सिस्टम में पहले से ही संस्थापित है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Gedit can be launched by searching for gedit in Dash Home and clicking the text editor icon.",
      "evidence": "search box में gedit type करें text editor का icon दिखेगा इस पर click करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Gedit can also be launched via the terminal by pressing Ctrl + Alt + T, typing gedit, and pressing Enter.",
      "evidence": "terminal खोलने के लिए ctrl + alt + t कीज को एक साथ दबाएँ gedit type करें और enter दबाएँ"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The default tab name assigned to a new document in gedit is Untitled Document 1.",
      "evidence": "untitled document 1 named टैब देख सकते हैं यह gedit text editor द्वारा नए document का default name दिया गया है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "An asterisk displayed next to a file name in the tab indicates that the file has not been saved.",
      "evidence": "tab टैब में आप file के name से आगे asterisk देख सकते हैं इसका मतलब है कि file अभी सेव नहीं हुई है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The status bar displays the cursor position in terms of line number and column number.",
      "evidence": "status bar line number और column number के संबंध में cursor की स्थिति को प्रदर्शित करता है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The default text mode in gedit is insert mode, indicated as ins.",
      "evidence": "default रूप से यह ins में होता है जो कि insert mode है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "To save a file, click the File option in the menu bar and select Save.",
      "evidence": "menu bar में file option पर click करें और फिर save पर click करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "To close an open file, click File in the menu bar and choose Close.",
      "evidence": "menu bar में file पर click करें और close को चुनें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "A new file can be created by clicking the plus sign icon on the toolbar.",
      "evidence": "toolbar में plus साइन के icon पर click करके भी खोल सकते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "An existing document can be opened by clicking File in the menu bar and selecting Open.",
      "evidence": "menu bar में file पर click करें और open चुनें"
    }
  ]
}
